”；晏含笑赞之“可谓要言不烦也”","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-4236cb142b3b53ade747","label":"裴注·辂别传","text":"邓飏与晏共坐，问君见谓善《易》而语初不及《易》中辞义何故；辂寻声答曰“夫善《易》者，不论《易》也”；晏含笑赞之“可谓要言不烦也”","evidence":["fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0028","role":"问者","evidence":["fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1"]},{"person":"fangji-p-f06456c2a8f978","role":"答者","evidence":["fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0020","role":"赞者","evidence":["fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1","order":6039}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0028","name":"邓飏","evidence":["shaodi-q-o043","xiahoucao-q-o060","wgc-q0022","wgc-q0109","huanchen-q-640e7a4e811c44aadbf5","huanchen-q-1ad31c5c5fda82d8db29","chengguo-q-abab53a6a585c5a6f439","yuanzhang-q-ff3937802b71891a1f57","cuimao-q-01300d70372557e1c746","zhonghua-q-b6fc9dd007cb857085d4","fangji-q-76e8566fffc9b0efc93d","fangji-q-7fccc0458f27e7af6b46","fangji-q-96c654b9630dfbb42cd9","fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1"],"facts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-f0047","label":"字","text":"玄茂","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0047-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"玄茂","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0047-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o043-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o043"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o060-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o060"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o061-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o061"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o062-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o062"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o071-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o071"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p037-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p037"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o026-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及邓飏","evidence":["wgc-q0022"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p026-shaodi-p0028","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及邓飏","evidence":["wgc-q0109"]},{"id":"chengguo-m-64f48689e29143033230","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及邓飏","evidence":["chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-638af399fce9c15caee2","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-3a2b46a05a26ac9ea80b","layer":"original","quote":"是时，曹爽专政，丁谧、邓飏等，轻改法度。会有日食变，诏群臣问其得失。济上疏曰：“昔大舜佐治，戒在比周〖3〗；周公辅政，慎于其朋〖4〗；齐侯问灾〖5〗，晏婴对以布惠〖6〗；鲁君问异〖7〗，臧孙答以缓役〖8〗：应天塞变〖9〗，乃实人事。今二贼未灭，将士暴露已数十年；男女怨旷，百姓贫苦。夫为国法度，惟命世大才，乃能张其纲维以垂于后，岂中下之吏所宜改易哉！终无益于治，适足伤民。望宜使文武之臣，各守其职，率以清平；则和气祥瑞，可感而致也","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":274,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-abab53a6a585c5a6f439","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-10ae3325dca8a4b70f04","layer":"original","quote":"帝于是发切诏〖25〗，斥免诸葛诞、邓飏等。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":363,"end":384,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-01300d70372557e1c746","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a86b26286383fccaf981","layer":"original","quote":"飏讯狱，将致泰重刑。岐数飏曰〖6〗：“夫枢机大臣，王室之佐；既不能辅化成德，齐美古人；而乃肆其私忿，枉论无辜〖7〗。使百姓危心，非此焉在！”飏于是惭怒而退","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":37,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-3eba29525514a7f6ae05","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a86b26286383fccaf981","layer":"original","quote":"南阳圭泰尝以言迕指，考系廷尉","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-76e8566fffc9b0efc93d","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-f7c7ed787f4de17f12f9","layer":"original","quote":"十二月二十八日，吏部尚书何晏请之。邓飏在晏许，晏谓辂曰：“闻君（著）〔蓍〕爻神妙〖1〗，试为作一卦：知位当至三公不？”又问：“连梦见青蝇数十头〖2〗，来在鼻上，驱之不肯去，有何意故","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":365,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-7fccc0458f27e7af6b46","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-1356231822f727238bab","layer":"original","quote":"飏曰：“此老生之常谈。”辂答曰：“夫老生者见不生〖21〗，常谈者见不谈。”晏曰：“过岁更当相见","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-8c61794f14f2d4edc8a1","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-adab935d2f5037aa4ab3","layer":"pei","quote":"时邓飏与晏共坐，飏言：‘君见谓善《易》，而语初不及《易》中辞义，何故也？’辂寻声答之曰：‘夫善《易》者，不论《易》也。’晏含笑而赞之：‘可谓要言不烦也","attribution":"裴注·辂别传","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":394,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0df158ae78c9ac8ac46e","start":47,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"fangji-q-96c654b9630dfbb42cd9","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-1356231822f727238bab","layer":"original","quote":"闻晏、飏皆诛，然后舅氏乃服","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":119,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houzhu-q-O053","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-4d2ab6578239f0eee393","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春正月，魏诛大将军曹爽等，右将军夏侯霸来降。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-1ad31c5c5fda82d8db29","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9affbe81d5e4a7563a4e","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，出毓为廷尉，司隶毕轨又枉奏免官〖2〗。众论多讼之〖3〗，乃以毓为光禄勋","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":583,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-640e7a4e811c44aadbf5","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9b4c376fd69d2e299704","layer":"original","quote":"前此诸葛诞、邓飏等驰名誉〖21〗，有“四（窗）〔聪〕”、“八达”之诮〖22〗，帝疾之","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":544,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-eab65dfa414d83bb2fa7","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-f96cf5cd7e02c882caab","layer":"original","quote":"涪诸军及大将军费祎，自成都相继而至，魏军退还，如平本策","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":96,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o024b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-9169f5a71887ca42dbea","layer":"original","quote":"五月，癸巳〖14〗，讲《尚书》经通〖15〗。使太常以太牢祀孔子于辟雍，以颜渊配；赐太傅、大将军及侍讲者各有差。丙午〖16〗，大将军曹爽引军还。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":80,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o043b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33155276d789f594176b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：嘉平二年（公元 250）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-235bc158a4eae2a0609a","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗五年：正始五年（公元 244）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f0539e2dfb395a33b142","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o022","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-93d5da2e078d5ca12eb0","layer":"original","quote":"五年春二月〖13〗，诏大将军曹爽率众征蜀。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o043","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o046","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8bc97b77985c9cc83eeb","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏五月〖13〗，以征西将军郭淮为车骑将军〖14〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-91594aaa37c7f634c45a","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-217f7a92077c8b2f0cd5","layer":"original","quote":"曹爽诛","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":480,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0006","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"是时，凌外甥令狐愚以才能为兖州刺史，屯平阿〖3〗。舅甥并典兵，专淮南之重。凌就迁为司空〖4〗。司马宣王既诛曹爽，进凌为太尉，假节、钺。凌、愚密协计，谓齐王不任天位〖5〗，楚王彪长而才〖6〗，欲迎立彪都许昌。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0022","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-12a13b8751046de2d4db","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛诞字公休，琅邪阳都人〖1〗。诸葛丰后也〖2〗。初以尚书郎为荥阳令。﹝一﹞入为吏部郎。人有所属托〖3〗，辄显其言而承用之；后有当否，则公议其得失以为褒贬：自是群僚莫不慎其所举。累迁御史中丞、尚书，与夏侯玄、邓飏等相善；收名朝廷，京都翕然〖4〗。言事者以诞、飏等修浮华，合虚誉，渐不可长。明帝恶之，免诞官。﹝二﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0109","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a60df5631c12b6021cc3","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“是时，当世俊士散骑常侍夏侯玄、尚书诸葛诞、邓飏之徒，共相题表，以玄（畴）〔等〕四人为‘四聪’，诞（备）〔辈〕八人为‘八达’。中书监刘放子熙、孙资子密、吏部尚书卫臻子烈三人，咸不及比；以父居势位，容之为‘三豫’：凡十五人。帝以构长浮华，皆免官废锢。”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-755a241ddb9f85f85b2a","start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0164","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"司马宣王既诛曹爽","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0580","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a60df5631c12b6021cc3","layer":"pei","quote":"当世俊士散骑常侍夏侯玄、尚书诸葛诞、邓飏之徒，共相题表，以玄（畴）〔等〕四人为‘四聪’，诞（备）〔辈〕八人为‘八达’。中书监刘放子熙、孙资子密、吏部尚书卫臻子烈三人，咸不及比；以父居势位，容之为‘三豫’：凡十五人","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-755a241ddb9f85f85b2a","start":13,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0581","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a60df5631c12b6021cc3","layer":"pei","quote":"帝以构长浮华，皆免官废锢","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-755a241ddb9f85f85b2a","start":120,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o060a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-8e4ad1798ee19f92c5ab","layer":"original","quote":"南阳何晏、邓飏、李胜，沛国丁谧，东平毕轨，咸有声名，进趋于时〖8〗；明帝以其浮华，皆抑黜之〖9〗。及爽秉政，乃复进叙〖10〗，任为腹心。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o060b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-8e4ad1798ee19f92c5ab","layer":"original","quote":"飏等欲令爽立威名于天下，劝使伐蜀；爽从其言，宣王止之不能禁。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":68,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o061b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-07987637cc4b4315dd87","layer":"original","quote":"爽参军杨伟为爽陈形势：“宜急还〖12〗，不然将败。”﹝二﹞飏与伟争于爽前，伟曰：“飏、胜将败国家事〖13〗，可斩也！”爽不悦，乃引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o062a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-f39d7dc77da58c377bcf","layer":"original","quote":"初，爽以宣王年德并高，恒父事之〖1〗，不敢专行。及晏等进用，咸共推戴，说爽以“权重，不宜委之于人”。乃以晏、飏、谧为尚书，晏典选举；轨司隶校尉，胜河南尹：诸事希复由宣王。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o071b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-650ce0d2c114d6dfb6ac","layer":"original","quote":"于是收晏等下狱，会公卿朝臣，廷议〖2〗，以为：“《春秋》之义，‘君亲无将，将而必诛’〖3〗。爽以支属〖4〗，世蒙殊宠，亲受先帝握手遗诏，托以天下；而包藏祸心，蔑弃顾命〖5〗，乃与晏、飏及当等谋图神器；范党同罪人：皆为大逆不道〖6〗。”于是收爽、羲、训、晏、飏、谧、轨、胜、范、当等，皆伏诛，夷三族。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p037a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-243ec6e420fd9fe7c8a6","layer":"pei","quote":"邓飏字玄茂。邓禹后也。少得士名于京师。明帝时为尚书郎，除洛阳令。坐事免，拜中郎，又入兼中书郎。初，飏与李胜等为浮华友。及在中书，浮华事发，被斥出，遂不复用。正始初，乃出为颍川太守。转大将军长史，迁侍中、尚书。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":370,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":1,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p037b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-243ec6e420fd9fe7c8a6","layer":"pei","quote":"飏为人好货，前在内职，许臧艾授以显官，艾以父妾与飏。故京师为之语曰：‘以官易妇邓玄茂。’每所荐达，多如此比。故何晏选举不得人，颇由飏之不公忠；遂同其罪，盖由交友非其才。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":370,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":105,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0047-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-243ec6e420fd9fe7c8a6","layer":"pei","quote":"邓飏字玄茂","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":370,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":1,"end":6,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o060","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-8e4ad1798ee19f92c5ab","layer":"original","quote":"南阳何晏、邓飏、李胜，沛国丁谧，东平毕轨，咸有声名，进趋于时〖8〗；明帝以其浮华，皆抑黜之〖9〗。及爽秉政，乃复进叙〖10〗，任为腹心。飏等欲令爽立威名于天下，劝使伐蜀；爽从其言，宣王止之不能禁。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o061","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-07987637cc4b4315dd87","layer":"original","quote":"正始五年，爽乃西至长安，大发卒六七万人，从骆谷入。是时，关中及氐、羌转输不能供〖11〗，牛马骡驴多死，民夷号泣道路。入谷行数百里，贼因山为固，兵不得进。爽参军杨伟为爽陈形势：“宜急还〖12〗，不然将败。”﹝二﹞飏与伟争于爽前，伟曰：“飏、胜将败国家事〖13〗，可斩也！”爽不悦，乃引军还。﹝三﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o062","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-f39d7dc77da58c377bcf","layer":"original","quote":"初，爽以宣王年德并高，恒父事之〖1〗，不敢专行。及晏等进用，咸共推戴，说爽以“权重，不宜委之于人”。乃以晏、飏、谧为尚书，晏典选举；轨司隶校尉，胜河南尹：诸事希复由宣王。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o071","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-650ce0d2c114d6dfb6ac","layer":"original","quote":"初，张当私以所择才人张、何等，与爽。疑其有奸，收当治罪。当陈：“爽与晏等阴谋反逆〖1〗，并先习兵，须三月中欲发。”于是收晏等下狱，会公卿朝臣，廷议〖2〗，以为：“《春秋》之义，‘君亲无将，将而必诛’〖3〗。爽以支属〖4〗，世蒙殊宠，亲受先帝握手遗诏，托以天下；而包藏祸心，蔑弃顾命〖5〗，乃与晏、飏及当等谋图神器；范党同罪人：皆为大逆不道〖6〗。”于是收爽、羲、训、晏、飏、谧、轨、胜、范、当等，皆伏诛，夷三族。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":209,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o108-review","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e8aa83f31b75ca2487ba","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：夏侯、曹氏，世为婚姻。故惇、渊、仁、洪、休、尚、真等，并以亲旧肺腑〖1〗，贵重于时；左右勋业〖2〗，咸有效劳〖3〗。爽德薄位尊，沉溺盈溢〖4〗；此固大《易》所著〖5〗，道家所忌也〖6〗。玄以规格局度〖7〗，世称其名；然与曹爽中外缱绻〖8〗，荣位如斯；曾未闻匡弼其非，援致良才。举兹以论，焉能免之乎〖9〗？","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":643,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p037","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-243ec6e420fd9fe7c8a6","layer":"pei","quote":"“邓飏字玄茂。邓禹后也。少得士名于京师。明帝时为尚书郎，除洛阳令。坐事免，拜中郎，又入兼中书郎。初，飏与李胜等为浮华友。及在中书，浮华事发，被斥出，遂不复用。正始初，乃出为颍川太守。转大将军长史，迁侍中、尚书。飏为人好货，前在内职，许臧艾授以显官，艾以父妾与飏。故京师为之语曰：‘以官易妇邓玄茂。’每所荐达，多如此比。故何晏选举不得人，颇由飏之不公忠；遂同其罪，盖由交友非其才。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":370,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-45775d68baddd17aab59","start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-ff3937802b71891a1f57","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-395deda2481618aa15f6","layer":"original","quote":"疾何晏、邓飏等，著论以讥切之","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":70,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-37e07eae83e346bcd0ec","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-98a6c102516e282eb801","layer":"original","quote":"爽闻之，戒何晏等曰：“当共慎之！公卿已比诸君前世恶人矣。”","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":478,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":92,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-b6fc9dd007cb857085d4","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-98a6c102516e282eb801","layer":"original","quote":"肃与太尉蒋济、司农桓范论及时政，肃正色曰：“此辈即弘恭、石显之属〖1〗，复称说邪！”","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":478,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
